<title>FINLAND: ASPO 4-MONTH PROFIT RISES TO FIM 33.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>ASPO 4-MONTH PROFIT RISES TO FIM 33.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    33.6 vs 7.8</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   5.85 vs 1.45</p>
<p> Net sales					  395.7 vs 339.2</p>
<p> Operating profit				  36.2 vs 9.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of analysts' forecast for Finnish</p>
<p>chemicals and electronic components maker Aspoyhtyma Oy's</p>
<p>January-April profit before extraordinary items had been 34</p>
<p>million markka in a 27-42 million markka range.</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	72.1 vs 44.7</p>
<p> Depreciation					35.9 vs 35.0</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 2.6 vs 1.9 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary income			     0.1 vs nil</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses			   0.1 vs 0.1</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes	     33.6 vs 7.7</p>
<p> Net profit					  25.2 vs 5.9</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    47.6 vs 44.3</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
